  "Miracle Ichi-Boat": "",
  "<size=22>Ram: Miracle Ichi-Boat</size>": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to random foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of Max HP ($1 hits). From the second hit, prioritize new targets and change damage to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> for hits on the same target. Increase all allies' DMG Bonus by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> (based on Ichigo's Max HP, up to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> bonus DMG Bonus at <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> Max HP). Lasts for $7 turns. If another Psy character is present, grant Ichigo [Illusion Seal].\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Berry Magic! Pearl's fantasy land!</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Max HP. Increase all allies' DMG Bonus by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> (based on Ichigo's Max HP, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> bonus DMG Bonus at <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> Max HP). Lasts for $5 turns. If another [Summer] character is present, grant Ichigo [Ocean's Seal].\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Berry Magic! Let the tides engulf you!</color></size></b>": "",
  "Cooldown Time: 1 turn.\\nRestore HP to all allies equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Ichigo's Max HP + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Increase all allies' Crit Rate by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $4 turns. If Ichigo has [Illusion Seal]/[Ocean's Seal], spend the corresponding Seal to increase all Psy/[Summer] characters' Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> (based on Ichigo's Max HP, up to <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> Max HP). Then select the skill main target as the [Helmsman]. At the end of the [Helmsman]'s turn, Ichigo will use [Ram: Miracle Ichi-Boat], then the [Helmsman] will step down.\\n[Ram: Miracle Ichi-Boat]: Deal damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color> of the [Miracle Ichi-Boat]'s Max HP + <color=#FFFC40>$9</color> of the [Helmsman]'s ATK. The attribute is identical to the [Helmsman]'s Persona. If Ichigo spends any [Seal] when using [Heart's Desire], increase the [Helmsman]'s ATK multiplier for this damage to <color=#FFFC40>$10</color>. This damage counts as a Persona skill and is calculated using the [Helmsman]'s Pierce, DMG Bonus, DMG Amp, Crit Rate, Crit DMG, Weak DMG, and <link=\"s|243\"><u>[Down ATK]</u></link>. Increase damage by $12 for each foe that decreases from $11.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Target confirmed! Set sail, Miracle Ichi-Boat!</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Restore HP to all allies equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Ichigo's Max HP + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Increase their DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> and Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> for $5 turns.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Psy damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "When healing an ally, remove $1 debuff from them, then increase their ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turn.": "",
  "When healing an ally, remove $1 debuff from them, then increase their ATK by <color=#0169ca>$2</color> for $3 turn.": "",
  "During battle, increase Ichigo's Healing Effect by $3 for every $2 points of Max HP above $1, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>.": "",
  "During battle, increase Ichigo's Healing Effect by $3 for every $2 points of Max HP above $1, up to <color=#0169ca>$4</color>.": "",
  "Magical Ichigo Sets Sail": "",
  "Before the first character's action in battle, {{A}} will invite all allies to board the [Miracle Ichi-Boat]. The [Miracle Ichi-Boat]'s current HP and Max HP are recorded as the sum of all allies' current HP and Max HP. Then decrease all allies' HP to 1 and grant them Null Insta-Kill. When all allies would take damage or receive healing, the [Miracle Ichi-Boat] will take those instead. {{A}} will faint when the [Miracle Ichi-Boat] reaches at 0 HP.\\nWhen the [Miracle Ichi-Boat] is sailing, at the start of any ally's' turn, {{A}} will restore their HP equal to $1 of the [Miracle Ichi-Boat]'s Max HP.": "",
  "Ocean's First Glimmer": "",
  "Increase the [Miracle Ichi-Boat]'s Max HP by $1. When its HP first reaches 0, restore $2 of its Max HP. [Ram: Miracle Ichi-Boat] additionally increase the target's Crit DMG Taken by $3 for $4 turns.": "",
  "Tide's Call from Afar": "",
  "Increase buff effects from [Romantic Pearl] and [Astral Anchor] for the [Helmsman] by $1. At the start of the [Helmsman]'s turn, increase their ATK by $2 for $3 turns.": "",
  "Two Hearts Meet Here": "",
  "The Course Guides the Way": "",
  "HIGHLIGHT Enhanced: Increase the main target's DMG Bonus by $1 and Healing Received by $2 for $3 turns.": "",
  "Destiny Sails Past the Bay": "",
  "Where Miracle Arrives": "",
  "[Heart's Desire] additionally increase the [Helmsman]'s Total DMG Amp by $1. The [Helmsman] will no longer step down. Only 1 ally can be the [Helmsman] at a time. At the end of every [Helmsman]'s turn, activate [Ram: Miracle Ichi-Boat]. Increase [Ram: Miracle Ichi-Boat]'s Skill Damage by $2.": "",
