  "Deal Psy damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $1 of Max HP. Increase <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies' DMG Bonus by $2 (based on Ichigo's Max HP, up to $4 bonus DMG Bonus at $3 Max HP). Lasts for $5 turns. If another [Summer] character is present, grant Ichigo [Ocean's Seal].": "",
  "Cooldown Time: 1 turn.\\nRestore HP to all allies equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Ichigo's Max HP + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Increase all allies' Crit Rate by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $4 turns. If Ichigo has [Illusion Seal]/[Ocean's Seal], spend the corresponding Seal to increase all Psy/[Summer] characters' Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> (based on Ichigo's Max HP, up to <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> bonus Crit DMG at <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> Max HP). Then select the skill main target as the [Helmsman]. At the end of the [Helmsman]'s turn, Ichigo will use [Ram: Miracle Ichi-Boat], then the [Helmsman] will step down.\\n[Ram: Miracle Ichi-Boat]: Deal damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color> of the [Miracle Ichi-Boat]'s Max HP + <color=#FFFC40>$9</color> of the [Helmsman]'s ATK. The attribute is identical to the [Helmsman]'s Persona. If Ichigo spends any [Seal] when using [Heart's Desire], increase the [Helmsman]'s ATK multiplier for this damage to <color=#FFFC40>$10</color>. This damage counts as a Persona skill and is calculated using the [Helmsman]'s Pierce, DMG Bonus, DMG Amp, Crit Rate, Crit DMG, Weak DMG, and <link=\"s|243\"><u>[Down ATK]</u></link>. Increase damage by $12 for each foe that decreases from $11.": "",
  "Cooldown Time: 1 turn.\\nRestore HP to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies equal to $1 of Ichigo's Max HP + $2. Increase <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies' Crit Rate by $3 for $4 turns. If Ichigo has [Illusion Seal]/[Ocean's Seal], spend the corresponding Seal to increase <color=#FFFF00>all</color> Psy/[Summer] characters' Crit DMG by $5 (based on Ichigo's Max HP, up to $7 bonus Crit DMG at $6 Max HP). Then select the <color=#FFFF00>skill main target</color> as the [Helmsman]. At the end of the [Helmsman]'s turn, Ichigo will use [Ram: Miracle Ichi-Boat], then the [Helmsman] will step down.\\n[Ram: Miracle Ichi-Boat]: Deal damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $8 of the [Miracle Ichi-Boat]'s Max HP + $9 of the [Helmsman]'s ATK. The attribute is identical to the [Helmsman]'s Persona. If Ichigo spends any [Seal] when using [Heart's Desire], increase the [Helmsman]'s ATK multiplier for this damage to $10. This damage counts as a Persona skill and is calculated using the [Helmsman]'s Pierce, DMG Bonus, DMG Amp, Crit Rate, Crit DMG, Weak DMG, and Down ATK. Increase damage by $12 for each foe that decreases from $11.": "",
